{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve probably seen the news. The entire country is waiting for answers in the Veronika case, the 21 years old girl whose life was taken in such a brutal way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pressure is immense, but I trust that with your expertise, we can get to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.poster.avif?t=1765124354\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.webm?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.mp4?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get <strong>a detective job</strong>, and now, on the first day, you have to deal with the <strong>country\u2019s biggest case.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our police are useless, so we\u2019re calling you from abroad. We\u2019ve prepared <strong>every case file</strong>, every shred of evidence and more importantly a brand new, cutting edge <strong>lie detector device</strong> for you. Examine the evidence, interrogate the suspect and deliver your <strong>verdict</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/f00dfe5c7f692c1682c694efb13b95c2.poster.avif?t=1765124354\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/f00dfe5c7f692c1682c694efb13b95c2.webm?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/f00dfe5c7f692c1682c694efb13b95c2.mp4?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Based on a True Story.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Drink Your Coffee! It\u2019s All in Your Head!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to air pollution and fatigue, if you do not take coffee, <strong>hallucinations</strong> begin, and you start seeing things everywhere, stemming from your <strong>subconscious</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/156dc0f7cbe87f6991ebc2556ddf061b.poster.avif?t=1765124354\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/156dc0f7cbe87f6991ebc2556ddf061b.webm?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/156dc0f7cbe87f6991ebc2556ddf061b.mp4?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Gets Worse:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fact checking with <strong>a Lie Detector Device</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggling <strong>Cables</strong> to keep devices running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search</strong> thorough case files and discover deeper conspiracies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fatigue induced <strong>hallucinations</strong> through a coffee-making minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating <strong>Non-Euclidean</strong> spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey \u2026 <strong>DO NOT</strong> get caught by <strong>THAT THING!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your<strong> Choice</strong> matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic\u00a0Realism\u00a0</strong>at its finest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/29357c613d9db185857329c2fe48587a.poster.avif?t=1765124354\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/29357c613d9db185857329c2fe48587a.webm?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/29357c613d9db185857329c2fe48587a.mp4?t=1765124354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705940?t=1765124354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705940?t=1765124354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/a650f83f1b6ebbb39536c70bc0ae12a209d3f82b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765124354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/a650f83f1b6ebbb39536c70bc0ae12a209d3f82b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765124354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"a